      en: ["The highest point of the ridge is Ormaņkalns (165 meters).", "It belongs to the geomorphological structure of the Sauka Nature Park.", "Lake Sauka, covering 15 km², is the largest lake in Sēlija.", "The ridge was formed by terminal moraine accumulations.", "The region hosts rare boreal coniferous forest ecosystems.", "The site is located about 30 kilometers west of the city of Jēkabpils."],
