      en: ["The Ezere Ridge is part of the Western Courland Highland system.", "Maximum elevations in the area reach up to 110 meters above sea level.", "The Vadakste River serves as a natural border with Lithuania here.", "Glacial moraine deposits dominate the geological structure of the ridge.", "The area is characterized by high biodiversity in its forest ecosystems.", "The relief was formed during the final stages of the Weichselian glaciation."],
