      en: ["The Ugāle Hill area reaches its peak elevation at 65 meters.", "It is located in the transitional zone between the highland and the coast.", "Ugāle is home to the oldest pipe organ in Latvia, dating back to 1701.", "The area contains some of the highest-quality timber resources in the Baltics.", "The Užava River basin begins in the marshy valleys between these hills.", "Glacial meltwater deposited the thick sand layers that define the relief."],
